# =====================================================================
# SUPABASE & VERCEL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES CONFIGURATION
# =====================================================================
# The system automatically recognizes all standard Vercel and Supabase
# environment variable naming conventions:

# 1. Standard Vercel + Supabase Integration variables:
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# 2. Generic Supabase variables:
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# 3. Standard Vite variables:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
